/1/episode/9"},{"id":"765739","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The police adopt a scorched earth policy in their attempts to flush Chirico and his allies out. Forced to run, the four take drastic measures to save their own lives.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1983-06-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1UsfZgdscAk9juwjj1J1YMeOfvj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1UsfZgdscAk9juwjj1J1YMeOfvj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"765740","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Prototype defies a direct order to engage Chirico in combat. The police chief and Borough attempt to discover why while the AT pilot dominates the battle.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1983-06-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q74koh9v0MvXeerRz3n8oi2huK1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q74koh9v0MvXeerRz3n8oi2huK1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"765741","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Chirico and the Prototype are discussing their situation when the police discover their location. Borough proposes that Battling pilots chase after them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1983-06-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jxU2hFuUjdBSAxNR80XDAxTp4Sv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jxU2hFuUjdBSAxNR80XDAxTp4Sv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/32377/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"765742","seasonNumber":1,"episo